---
config:
  theme: redux
  look: classic
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Enter Markdown]
    B --> C[Select template]
    C --> D[Click Generate PDF]
    D --> E{What type of error occurred?}

    E -- Syntax error --> F[Show syntax error and line number]
    E -- Missing field --> G[Show missing required field]
    E -- Compilation error --> H[Show compilation diagnostic]

    F --> I[Correct document]
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[Validate document again]
    J --> K{Is the document valid?}

    K -- No --> E
    K -- Yes --> L[Generate PDF]
    L --> M([End])